cess\n- Address financial security: patient may not be able to work during recovery; connect with disability benefits, crime victim compensation, FMLA\n- School arrangements for children\n\n**5. Staff Safety and Awareness**:\n- Flag the chart that this is a violence-related injury\n- Restrict visitor access; verify visitor identity\n- If assailant attempts to visit, notify security and law enforcement immediately\n- Educate rehabilitation staff about domestic violence dynamics (do not judge patient for prior relationship history)\n\n**6. Long-term Follow-up**:\n- Continued domestic violence counseling\n- PTSD treatment (see Domain E)\n- Re-assess safety at every outpatient visit\n- Community resources: support groups for DV survivors, children\'s counseling services',
