e Therapy** -- both have strong evidence. We can also consider starting medication. The SSRI I am recommending for your depression, sertraline, is also FDA-approved for PTSD and can help with the nightmares and hyperarousal.\n\nFor sleep specifically, we can try **prazosin** -- it is a medication that helps reduce trauma-related nightmares. Many of my patients find it makes a significant difference.\n\nI also want you to know: what happened to you is not your fault. You did nothing to deserve this. And you are showing incredible strength by being here and working on your recovery.\n\nIs there anything we can do right now to help you feel safer on this unit?"',
